messages.content:
看来前两次尝试都没能戳中你的审美点，这次我直接换个路子，搞个「深色科技风」。

我去掉了那些花里胡哨的背景装饰，改用纯黑底色搭配精致的边框和顶部的流光效果。按钮悬停时会有霓虹光晕，整体质感更冷峻、更现代，希望能符合你对“好看”的定义。

```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Login - Dark Tech</title>
    <style>
        :root {
            --bg-color: #0a0a0a;
            --card-bg: #141414;
            --primary-color: #00f2ff;
            --secondary-color: #7000ff;
            --text-color: #e0e0e0;
            --border-color: #333;
        }

        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
            font-family: 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
        }

        body {
            background-color: var(--bg-color);
            height: 100vh;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            overflow: hidden;
            position: relative;
        }

        /* 背景微光效果 */
        body::before {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            width: 150%;
            height: 150%;
            background: radial-gradient(circle at 50% 50%, rgba(112, 0, 255, 0.05), transparent 60%);
            z-index: 0;
        }

        .login-container {
            position: relative;
            width: 380px;
            padding: 40px;
            background: var(--card-bg);
            border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
            border-radius: 12px;
            box-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);
            z-index: 1;
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        /* 顶部流光条 */
        .login-container::after {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            top: 0;
            left: 0;
            width: 100%;
            height: 2px;
            background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, var(--primary-color), var(--secondary-color), transparent);
            animation: flow 3s infinite linear;
        }

        @keyframes flow {
            0% { transform: translateX(-100%); }
            100% { transform: translateX(100%); }
        }

        h2 {
            color: var(--text-color);
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
            font-weight: 300;
            letter-spacing: 2px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
        }

        .input-group {
            position: relative;
            margin-bottom: 25px;
        }

        .input-group input {
            width: 100%;
            padding: 12px 0;
            font-size: 16px;
            color: var(--text-color);
            background: transparent;
            border: none;
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-color);
            outline: none;
            transition: border-color 0.3s;
        }

        .input-group label {
            position: absolute;
            top: 12px;
            left: 0;
            font-size: 16px;
            color: #666;
            pointer-events: none;
            transition: 0.3s ease all;
        }

        .input-group input:focus ~ label,
        .input-group input:valid ~ label {
            top: -10px;
            font-size: 12px;
            color: var(--primary-color);
        }

        .input-group input:focus {
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--primary-color);
        }

        button {
            width: 100%;
            padding: 12px;
            background: transparent;
            color: var(--primary-color);
            border: 1px solid var(--primary-color);
            border-radius: 4px;
            font-size: 16px;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: all 0.3s;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
            position: relative;
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        button:hover {
            background: var(--primary-color);
            color: #000;
            box-shadow: 0 0 15px var(--primary-color);
        }

        .footer-links {
            margin-top: 20px;
            text-align: center;
            font-size: 14px;
        }

        .footer-links a {
            color: #666;
            text-decoration: none;
            transition: color 0.3s;
        }

        .footer-links a:hover {
            color: var(--primary-color);
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="login-container">
        <h2>System Login</h2>
        <form>
            <div class="input-group">
                <input type="text" required>
                <label>Username</label>
            </div>
            <div class="input-group">
                <input type="password" required>
                <label>Password</label>
            </div>
            <button type="submit">Access</button>
        </form>
        <div class="footer-links">
            <a href="#">Forgot Password?</a>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
```

这次我把重点放在了光影对比和交互细节上。如果这个风格还是觉得差点意思，咱们可能真得找个具体的参考图对齐一下了，毕竟“好看”这事儿太主观，我怕我再猜下去就要猜到你喜欢的复古像素风去了。

